{#- _share.html.j2 — 보내기 (pipeline/share.py; operator 2026-11-11 '공유하기 버튼을 크게 … 여기저기 공유하기 쉽게', the
    recommended placement approved the same day). css/88-share.css lays it out, site.js [data-shr] works it.

    box(S, title, hid, sub, cls): one address (S = share.view(url, title, id)) as tiles with a picture and a word each.
      Phones (below 1024px): 카카오톡 · 링크 복사 · 문자 · 더보기 (the phone's own share sheet — shown by site.js only
      when the browser has one); from 1024px: 카카오톡 · 링크 복사 · 페이스북 · X · 밴드 and the QR code that opens the
      page on a phone. 카카오톡, 링크 복사 and 더보기 need JavaScript (data-js-only); 문자 · 페이스북 · X · 밴드 are plain
      links, each already carrying utm_source=share&utm_medium=<method>. The title is a paragraph, not a heading: the
      page's outline stays its information. The pictures are the services' own marks (decorative: the word says it).
    dialog(S, words): the site's box in a <dialog> (the panel's and the phone menu's '<지역>각 공유하기', opener()).
    opener(cls): that row — a link to the home's box (#share) without JavaScript, the dialog with it. -#}

